#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/udisks2.xml:29
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>UDisks</application> package provides a daemon, tools and "
"libraries to access and manipulate disks and storage devices."
